# Browse: the countries (International first; the languages; the counts without the podcasts), the topics of a country,
# the feeds of a topic with the favorite toggle (a tap on the selected row pins or unpins it: blue dot, empty ring); the
# title follows the path and is shortened in the middle when it would reach the Esc button; the search over the whole
# catalog (typed with a keyboard, or with the on-screen keyboard while none is connected).
seed refresh_on_open off
wait 900
key down
key enter
wait 500
expect state page browse
expect text "International"
expect notext "Podcasts"
shot 01-countries
check countries
tap "France"
tap "France"
wait 400
expect state blevel 1
shot 02-topics
check topics
expect notext "Podcasts"
tap "Technology"
tap "Technology"
wait 400
expect state blevel 2
shot 03-feeds
check feeds
tap "Korben"
wait 500
expect state pinned 1
shot 04-pinned
tap "Korben"
wait 500
expect state pinned 0
shot 05-unpinned
tap "Korben"
wait 500
expect state pinned 1
key esc
wait 300
expect state blevel 1
key esc
wait 300
expect state blevel 0
key up
key up
key enter
wait 400
tap "Technology"
tap "Technology"
wait 400
shot 06-int-technology
key esc
wait 200
key esc
wait 200
# the search with a keyboard: letters go to the field
type linux
wait 400
expect state search linux
shot 07-search
check search
key down
key enter
wait 500
expect state pinned 2
shot 08-search-pinned
key esc
wait 300
expect state search ""
# without a keyboard: a tap on the field brings the on-screen keyboard
keyboard off
tapfield 1
wait 600
expect osk on
expect state typing search
shot 09-search-osk
check search-osk
type nasa
wait 300
key enter
wait 600
expect osk off
shot 10-search-results
keyboard on
key esc
wait 300
key esc
wait 300
expect state page home
